Hey, all of you!

12:24.760 --> 12:26.840
What're you doing here?

12:26.840 --> 12:29.770
Let's go to the cafeteria, it's time for dinner!

12:29.770 --> 12:33.430
Sumino, are you okay?

12:33.430 --> 12:35.350
You were badly injured.

12:36.560 --> 12:39.650
Ah, right...

12:39.650 --> 12:40.900
Lying?

12:40.900 --> 12:43.360
You were near death just now.

12:43.360 --> 12:47.450
Anyway, why do you all look so good?

12:47.450 --> 12:49.370
I-I wonder...

12:49.370 --> 12:52.540
Maybe we're just young.

12:52.540 --> 12:55.290
Nothing to worry about here!

12:55.290 --> 12:56.300
That's right!

12:58.210 --> 13:02.130
There's no need for anyone to worry.

13:02.130 --> 13:06.840
As long as this hand can move,

13:07.220 --> 13:10.260
I'll definitely do my best to massage everyone!

13:11.060 --> 13:12.850
L-Leo...

13:13.520 --> 13:15.560
Why'd you bring him along?!

13:15.560 --> 13:17.020
Because...

13:17.020 --> 13:18.110
Because what?!

13:19.900 --> 13:22.650
Come on, everyone from Shiradama...

13:29.740 --> 13:35.910
A pack of lions is made up of
one male and several females.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.830
That's called a harem.

13:38.670 --> 13:42.920
During mating season, each coupling lasts for only twenty seconds.

13:42.920 --> 13:46.760
But it's said they're doing it 
more than fifty times a day.

13:46.760 --> 13:48.260
Isn't that amazing?

13:48.260 --> 13:52.430
All the scenes shown during this 
monologue are nothing but fantasies.

13:52.430 --> 13:55.060
They're irrelevant to this show.

13:56.730 --> 13:57.810
Oh?

13:57.810 --> 13:59.400
Hey, listen,

13:59.400 --> 14:02.530
if you're tired, you don't have 
to force yourselves to dinner.

14:03.860 --> 14:06.400
Nah. You could even say that we're in tip-top shape!

14:15.790 --> 14:18.300
Amazing! The futons are already laid out!

14:18.710 --> 14:20.830
It's cold at night, be careful!

14:20.830 --> 14:25.050
Hey, there's a really childish one.

14:26.130 --> 14:28.050
Sleeping on this is overdoing it.

14:31.390 --> 14:33.930
Hey, could this be Shidou's—

14:34.180 --> 14:36.430
N-No way!

14:36.770 --> 14:39.850
They just grabbed a children's futon by mistake!

14:39.850 --> 14:42.360
It'll be replaced immediately!

14:47.490 --> 14:49.700
<i>Forgive me, Playful Kitten!</i>

14:49.700 --> 14:53.620
<i>I have to maintain my image 
as national champion right now!</i>

14:54.370 --> 14:55.700
Don't worry!

15:01.630 --> 15:03.290
You understand, Yura?

15:03.290 --> 15:06.840
If you dare take any more weird videos 
of me, I'll lock you in the black room!

15:07.840 --> 15:11.680
<i>Actually, I only want to film the President.</i>

15:11.680 --> 15:14.470
<i>Yet I don't want to go in the black room.</i>

15:16.390 --> 15:17.680
Catch!

15:17.680 --> 15:19.680
Watch this!

15:20.730 --> 15:23.520
<i>No matter how many of these scenes I take...</i>

15:29.860 --> 15:32.070
<i>It's pointless...</i>

15:31.240 --> 15:33.200
So sexy!

15:34.450 --> 15:36.080
<i>Pointless...</i>

15:36.330 --> 15:38.160
<i>Pointless...</i>

15:52.680 --> 15:54.760
Ouch...

15:54.760 --> 15:57.970
Man, why is there a banana peel here?

15:57.970 --> 16:00.190
Ah, sorry.

16:00.190 --> 16:02.020
What an airhead.

16:02.020 --> 16:03.440
Shut up!

16:04.150 --> 16:05.810
<i>What should I do?!</i>

16:05.810 --> 16:09.820
<i>I clearly filmed something for adults!</i>

16:09.820 --> 16:11.700
<b><b>IMPRISONMENT
DECIDED</b></b>

16:17.080 --> 16:18.410
Hey, Leo-kun.

16:18.410 --> 16:19.370
Hm?

16:19.370 --> 16:20.200
Yes!

16:20.200 --> 16:23.920
It's a little hot, so do you 
want to go out for a walk?

16:24.540 --> 16:25.670
It's okay if you don't want to.

16:25.670 --> 16:29.090
I'll g-go! Even to the end of the world!

16:32.420 --> 16:35.680
Asuna-san, be careful not 
to trip when running so fast!

16:35.680 --> 16:36.800
It's okay.

16:37.140 --> 16:38.720
Because you're here.

16:42.270 --> 16:44.440
What star is that?

16:44.440 --> 16:47.150
T-That's the Star of Death.

16:47.770 --> 16:49.400
How pretty.

16:49.400 --> 16:51.070
It's the Death Star!

16:51.070 --> 16:51.690
By the way...

16:52.610 --> 16:57.160
<i>Today Asuna-san... is 
somehow sexier than normal!</i>

16:57.160 --> 16:59.780
<i>Just watching her makes my heart...</i>

16:59.780 --> 17:01.540
My heart's beating fast...

17:02.910 --> 17:05.670
from being able to have fun with everyone.

17:06.630 --> 17:08.630
Oh, that type of beating fast...

17:08.630 --> 17:11.800
Going on a school trip probably feels like this.

17:11.800 --> 17:15.550
I wasn't able to go in elementary school.

17:15.550 --> 17:17.220
Is that so?

17:18.140 --> 17:21.430
Did you get a cold? Or...

17:24.520 --> 17:25.350
It's a secret.

17:25.350 --> 17:26.140
It's a secret.

17:26.140 --> 17:26.940
It's a secret.

17:30.110 --> 17:33.190
Girls have many secrets.

17:33.190 --> 17:35.780
Is that true?!

17:36.990 --> 17:39.740
Actually, I was just...

17:40.780 --> 17:44.080
imagining everyone bathing together.

17:44.080 --> 17:47.080
Then I fainted because I 
bled too much from my nose.

17:47.830 --> 17:50.090
I was so young.

17:53.920 --> 17:57.470
<i>Asuna-san, what happened?</i>

17:59.340 --> 18:02.760
Hmm... I remember it to be around here.

18:02.760 --> 18:04.850
Ah, there it is!

18:13.110 --> 18:14.400
Oh right, Eli.

18:15.280 --> 18:19.110
You played normal tennis in England.

18:19.110 --> 18:21.320
How'd it go?

18:21.320 --> 18:23.540
Go?

18:23.540 --> 18:28.460
I participated in England's national competition.

18:28.460 --> 18:30.380
The nationals?!

18:30.380 --> 18:34.550
I see... Isn't this a little regrettable then?

18:34.550 --> 18:38.680
You were so good,
yet you switched to soft tennis.

18:38.680 --> 18:41.050
It is nothing like that.

18:41.970 --> 18:47.980
To me, the only regrettable 
days were those without Mishi.

18:49.650 --> 18:53.980
Now I am with Mishi, so I am very happy.

18:53.980 --> 18:55.030
But...

18:55.030 --> 19:00.910
And I played normal tennis 
because I mistook it to be soft tennis.

19:00.910 --> 19:04.450
When I realized that it was a different sport, I was already the national champion.

19:04.450 --> 19:06.080
You were even the champion?!

19:10.290 --> 19:13.130
There's another tennis fool here.

19:16.590 --> 19:18.210
Toilet, toilet...

19:17.630 --> 19:20.800
Mishi, how long are you staying here?

19:20.800 --> 19:22.430
<i>That sound is...</i>

19:24.600 --> 19:27.720
<i>Wh-Why're they here, alone with each other?</i>

19:27.720 --> 19:28.560
<i>A date...</i>{rendezvous}

19:28.560 --> 19:30.100
<i>Could this be a date?!</i>

19:32.310 --> 19:33.560
<i>Don't...</i>

19:36.110 --> 19:37.610
No!

19:37.980 --> 19:38.990
How...

19:38.990 --> 19:41.910
How could this be?

19:41.910 --> 19:46.280
Could they... already be in... 
<i>that</i> kind of relationship?

19:49.660 --> 19:51.000
I got it, Eli.

19:51.000 --> 19:54.750
For some reason there was a weasel in your hair.

19:54.750 --> 19:55.960
Wow!

20:11.310 --> 20:13.600
It's only you, Kotone-chan.

20:13.600 --> 20:17.150
It's really dark here, so you scared me a bit.

20:19.860 --> 20:22.110
Kotone-chan, have you brushed your teeth yet?

20:24.530 --> 20:25.870
Kotone-chan?

20:33.920 --> 20:34.750
Kotone-chan!

20:40.050 --> 20:41.420
Kotone-chan...

20:46.800 --> 20:48.560
What is it, Asuna-chan?

20:48.560 --> 20:51.890
Nothing. I just saw Kotone-chan in the hallway.

20:51.890 --> 20:54.350
She was acting a little weird.

20:55.270 --> 20:56.150
How so?

20:56.150 --> 21:00.400
It's hard to describe.

21:00.400 --> 21:03.780
But if I had to describe it...

21:04.030 --> 21:08.280
she was like a dewdrop
out of a dark, dry forest.

21:08.910 --> 21:12.160
Although the sudden,
fresh feeling is confusing her,

21:12.160 --> 21:16.960
she is somehow still overwhelmed by the urgings of her body.

21:16.960 --> 21:21.960
Ending in the abyss of shame
and soul-ravishing lust.

21:25.510 --> 21:26.380
Like that!

21:26.380 --> 21:28.470
What's she thinking?! Doing that in someone else's house!

21:29.470 --> 21:32.060
It's lights-off.

21:32.060 --> 21:34.390
Okay! Good night.

21:36.980 --> 21:40.150
Chitose-san, can I sleep with you?

21:40.150 --> 21:42.400
Of course you can!

21:44.940 --> 21:46.200
So warm!

21:46.200 --> 21:49.160
My body temperature seems to be above normal.

21:49.160 --> 21:52.240
Then I'll join in too.

21:52.870 --> 21:54.120
Me too.

21:54.120 --> 21:55.960
How sly. I'm in too.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.930
Too hot...

22:11.220 --> 22:12.310
Everyone, get up!

22:12.310 --> 22:13.310
Bad news!

22:14.520 --> 22:16.480
What is it, Asuna-chan?

22:16.480 --> 22:18.940
Hey, it's only five in the morning.

22:18.940 --> 22:20.610
Kotone-chan is missing!

22:20.610 --> 22:22.480
Her futon is still unused!

22:22.480 --> 22:26.650
She was strange last night, so I looked for her. I thought something bad had happened!

22:26.650 --> 22:29.070
I found this note on the door!

22:29.070 --> 22:30.990
A note?

22:31.910 --> 22:33.160
<b>I'm on a trip.</b>

22:31.910 --> 22:33.160
<b>Kotone</b>

22:35.410 --> 22:38.290
A-Aren't we already on a trip?

22:38.290 --> 22:40.170
Another trip?

22:55.220 --> 23:00.520
<b><i>I extended my arms up high</i></b>

22:55.220 --> 23:00.520
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

22:55.220 --> 23:00.520
高く高く腕を伸ばした

23:00.600 --> 23:05.980
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

23:00.600 --> 23:05.980
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

23:00.600 --> 23:05.980
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

23:06.110 --> 23:11.320
<b><i>I might be a crybaby</i></b>

23:06.110 --> 23:11.320
nakimushi dakedo sonna jibun mo

23:06.110 --> 23:11.320
泣き虫だけどそんな自分も

23:11.490 --> 23:16.870
<b><i>But I just can't hate myself, so I'm still here</i></b>

23:11.490 --> 23:16.870
kirai ni wa narenakute mada koko ni iru

23:11.490 --> 23:16.870
キライにはなれなくてまだココに居る

23:17.700 --> 23:22.880
<b><i>I dream about a tomorrow that I see far away</i></b>

23:17.700 --> 23:22.880
aa kogareta ashita wa mada tooku de

23:17.700 --> 23:22.880
ああ　焦がれた明日はまだ遠くで

23:23.080 --> 23:27.630
<b><i>It's smiling, beckoning</i></b>

23:23.080 --> 23:27.630
waratte iru temaneki shinagara

23:23.080 --> 23:27.630
笑っている　手招きしながら

23:27.920 --> 23:33.800
<b><i>Count 1 2 3 and raise up your heels</i></b>

23:27.920 --> 23:33.800
ichi ni san kazoe kakato wo agete miru

23:27.920 --> 23:33.800
123　数えかかとを上げてみる

23:34.100 --> 23:38.680
<b><i>Do it a little more, then just a little more</i></b>

23:34.100 --> 23:38.680
mou sukoshi sou ato sukoshi kurikaeshite wa

23:34.100 --> 23:38.680
もう少し　そうあと少し　繰り返しては

23:38.890 --> 23:43.980
<b><i>If I take a breath as deep as I can</i></b>

23:38.890 --> 23:43.980
dekiru dake ookiku iki wo shite

23:38.890 --> 23:43.980
出来るだけ大きく息をして

23:44.150 --> 23:49.030
<b><i>And imagine myself flying in the skies</i></b>

23:44.150 --> 23:49.030
sora wo tobu imeeji wo sureba

23:44.150 --> 23:49.030
空を飛ぶイメージをすれば

23:49.610 --> 23:54.320
<b><i>Then I can go anywhere!</i></b>

23:49.610 --> 23:54.320
doko e datte ikeru yo hora ne

23:49.610 --> 23:54.320
どこへだって行けるよほらね

23:55.530 --> 24:02.120
<b><i>I'm still dreaming of that one day when I might be able to fly</i></b>

23:55.530 --> 24:02.120
itsuka toberu kana nante yume minagara

23:55.530 --> 24:02.120
いつか飛べるかな　なんて夢見ながら

24:11.010 --> 24:11.880
I'm Chitose.

24:11.880 --> 24:12.930
I'm Kurusu.

24:12.930 --> 24:14.090
I'm Elizabeth.

24:14.090 --> 24:17.220
Three people. Together we're 
the Scarab Investigation Team!

24:17.220 --> 24:19.020
What's a scarab?

24:19.020 --> 24:19.970
A dung beetle.

24:20.730 --> 24:22.560
At least say herring roe or something!

24:22.560 --> 24:24.350
But that feels a little indecent.

24:22.980 --> 24:25.270
<b>Game 9</b>

24:22.980 --> 24:25.270
<b>Pause</b>

24:22.980 --> 24:25.270
<b>Next Episode:</b>

24:24.350 --> 24:25.270
See you.
